WEBVTT

00:01:57.994 --> 00:02:02.522
ambapo usawa wa kijinsi sio hakika.

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.844
Kukua katika nchi ile,

00:02:04.844 --> 00:02:08.095
Sikuweza kujichagulia katika maisha.

00:02:08.095 --> 00:02:10.393
Sikuweza hata kuzichungua

00:02:10.393 --> 00:02:13.389
nafasi za kibinafsi katika maisha yangu.

00:02:13.389 --> 00:02:15.919
Nitakuambieni hadithi

00:02:15.919 --> 00:02:18.381
ya wasichana wawili tofauti,

00:02:18.381 --> 00:02:22.026
wasichana wawili warembo.

00:02:22.026 --> 00:02:24.580
Hawa wasichana walikua

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.693
chini ya paa moja.

00:02:26.693 --> 00:02:29.410
Walikula chakula sawa sawa.

00:02:29.410 --> 00:02:32.173
Wakati wengine, wangezigawana nguo,